# Finding: ATM-QA-001-X4
# Boundary docs not updated to reflect IPC helper ownership
# Triaged: 2026-05-14T00:00:00Z (initial_pass)

<urn:atm:triage:finding/ATM-QA-001-X4>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "ATM-QA-001-X4" ;
  triage:title "Boundary docs not updated to reflect IPC helper ownership" ;
  triage:description "Two locations not updated: (1) docs/atm-daemon-client/boundaries.md:20-23 prose still uses conditional 'may own...when those helpers are extracted' — must be declarative: 'owns try_connect, exchange, unexpected_response'. (2) boundaries/atm-daemon-client/daemon-bootstrap.toml:26-30 — io_owns array missing try_connect, exchange, unexpected_response. Machine-readable contract does not reflect the consolidation verified by QA." ;
